      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Super 3-Bedroom Mid Terrace Home in Popular Area Excellent Investment Opportunity.\n\nLocated in a long established development, this well-presented 3-bedroom end of terrace property offers spacious and comfortable accommodation, making it an ideal investment opportunity.\n\nThe property is in great condition throughout and comprises a bright living room, functional kitchen, three bedrooms, and a well-appointed family bathroom.\n\nBeing sold with a tenant in situ, this is a fantastic chance for investors to acquire a ready-made rental property in a highly desirable area with strong rental demand.\n\nWithin short walking distance to Ballina town and all local amenities.\n\nDon't miss out on this excellent opportunity to add a quality asset to your portfolio in a thriving location.\n\nCall or email us for further information and to schedule your viewing."
      },
